@startuml
title JoinUp - Business Logic Class Diagram (Service)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction

package "internal/service" {
  interface EventRepo <<Port>> {
    + GetEventsByCreator(creator string) : []*models.Event
    + CreateEvent(event *models.Event) : error
  }

  class EventService <<Service>> {
    - eventRepo : EventRepo
    --
    + GetUserEvents(user string) : []*models.Event
  }
}

package "internal/models" {
  class Event <<Model>> {
    + Name : string
    + Desc : string
    + CreateTime : time.Time
    + Creator : string
    + Members : []string
    + Location : Location
  }

  class Location <<Model>> {
    + Name : string
    + Longitude : float64
    + Latitude : float64
  }
}

EventService --> EventRepo : depends on
EventService ..> Event : returns
EventRepo ..> Event : returns/accepts
Event *-- Location : contains

note right of EventService
  Business logic component.
  Orchestrates use-cases via repository port.
end note

@enduml
